{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And the fountains were stopped up.</b> When they were opened it is written כָּל מַעְיְנֹת — 'all the fountains'; but here כָּל is not written, because some of them remained — those that the world needs, such as the hot springs of Tiberias and the like." "<b>And He shut.</b> And He withheld — as in ״לֹא תִכְלָא רַחֲמֶיךָ״ (Psalms 40), ״לֹא יִכְלֶה מִמְּךָ״ (Genesis 23)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:54.947642663Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}